			"Message": "build(Cocoon): Update dependencies, normalize ESBuild config formatting, and regenerate RouteManifest\n\nBump @effect/platform-node to 0.107.0, protobufjs to 8.6.0, and Vitest ecosystem to 4.1.8. Apply consistent blank-line spacing after imports, between object properties, and around export blocks across all ESBuild configuration files (Bootstrap.js, Cocoon.js, Config/Base/Config.js, Config/Bootstrap/Config.js, Config/Compile/Config.js, Constant/Environment/Constant.js, Target.js, index.js, Configuration/Mountain/Config.js, Source/ESBuild.js) to match the project PascalCase style guide.\n\nRegenerate Source/Generated/RouteManifest.ts with updated timestamp and increment Mountain RPC method count from 142 to 145, reflecting three new FileWatcher methods (Unwatch, Watch, WatchStatus) added to the Mountain gRPC surface.",
